      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Update on Dietary Incident at Crestview Azure Resort\n\nDear Stakeholders,\n\nWe wish to inform you about an incident that transpired at the Crestview Azure resort last evening. Reports indicate that some guests experienced gastrointestinal distress. Health officials are investigating and have identified several cases of suspected salmonella, with three guests being admitted for observation at Crestview General Hospital. We are committed to supporting those affected and cooperating with local health authorities to address this matter. Our priority is the wellbeing of our guests, and we will continue to provide updates and necessary assistance as the investigation unfolds. Your concern is our utmost duty, and we appreciate your patience and understanding during this time.\n\nBest regards,  \n[Your Company Name]",
